{
  "schema_version": 1,
  "locale": "zh-CN",
  "scenario_id": "1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01",
  "source_raw_hash": "sha256:24693f6a8d4c17ed7c95518e4ea3fa9e679509001b5f913a3a0759da5848557f",
  "entries": {
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000000:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961439db6cc42a620cb6ff74340234958484432d75a6ed50d211e88e1ec64673",
      "text": "鲜花与摩托",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000000:synopsis:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2d5a930717a6a38bb9346afba962a4d62866e042c0cf5b3edaaa2a61405dcdb5",
      "text": "为了给共演者送上插花作为生日礼物，实和制作人来到了他曾工作过的花店挑选鲜花。在制作插花的过程中，实回想起了刚成为花店店员时的情景。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000010:title:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:7824b3a8948acd2c72636875e79b09adab6d8fca3c20b65cfcfd68e8d3eae4ba",
      "text": "第1话",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000010:title:001": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:961439db6cc42a620cb6ff74340234958484432d75a6ed50d211e88e1ec64673",
      "text": "鲜花与摩托",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4642a885dd1b8a29cea9f4eb93f55766755575a7d0f6021aa272020b1b3ec898",
      "text": "说的也是，这个时节的话应该选银莲花吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000021:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6bab9b00566fa98162c048fa297eca9f5f6b5ffc70432dae74c918eaebd9bef6",
      "text": "●●●●プロデューサー帮忙打听到了共演者喜欢白色，那颜色就统一选白色吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d74c8d8a79bb2766a635878e38d2edef1c92e11458d665fa5f4273e754489a34",
      "text": "花语也很合适呢！\n白色银莲花的花语是“希望”。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:45836edec627541a86d492a3bf26bf30fd92f7ee21a510ba7bc074ec1418d512",
      "text": "“希望”……用来作为生日礼物的\n插花真是再合适不过了呢！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000038:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:59c337929524f8826300024f703d6acba7ac40a734285acaf71fcedcef4d78e2",
      "text": "啊，这边的白非洲菊也用上吧。\n它的花语同样是“希望”哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f2fc4be75ab696ef349dcc71219ef405016dcebe1687055da29b75d042387a1f",
      "text": "那么，送的花就以白银莲花和白非洲菊为主吗？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000048:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:fcb42e1414f21a0684c824f6a228ba7a6aa233215c95c86eeedf9dd3e4f0e0f7",
      "text": "嗯，就这么定。……好啦，\n花也挑完了。接下来就包在我身上吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:074eae446427cedf5eb0521bd4644cf00d1728b81482c80db8996431157fb3da",
      "text": "呼，大概是这种感觉吧。\n你觉得怎么样？●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000078:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4694d2dc8a2b6dde84602f8c2b266bdd261ea6f5899bbd9862c9b4b0e016256d",
      "text": "我觉得非常棒！\n实先生真厉害啊……！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_a:cmd-000083:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a00a42d03987b436735243fc14f2495be83f5462443b70ac4ed1ccdc7a56686e",
      "text": "哈哈，手艺没生疏真是太好了。\n刚去花店工作那会儿可是吃了不少苦头呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000011:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:57a5677bb622a8c6358f1366e1c8b394fb039ac527e934c50768c1ad54acdacf",
      "text": "数年前……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c2f5d05f07137143bab39593f2d84263a2d3e255a3e1d7164f3bbf4f4259aebf",
      "text": "为什么不开花呢？\n我明明按照叔叔的做法浇了水啊……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:68149ff341914fccace9a1e0d3084610af8a68268a04e5f047df734b1d21a004",
      "text": "哎，这边怎么枯了……！？\n明明放在了向阳的地方啊！？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8a42f2887d0071f90319c1e203e8ce0912b1d549ed81e44f7fd3ee413345ddec",
      "text": "花束到底该怎么做啊。\n总之先把好看显眼的花凑在一起扎起来看看吧……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000030:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:6fb512a54279d51dca428e90d690e09db5bfeec4e1720dd5f175a852419d2b6e",
      "text": "几天后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:971a96435613c3159c569bc31d75df4c2d3b09fe0dbfd9db0d2684dfa9aa3ace",
      "text": "啊，花语！……完全没考虑到。\n糟了，前几天那束花的花语含义简直糟糕透顶啊。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000052:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:cfd01e9aa51be72881fdda2f5bc3a66f9f6eaefdbfde34cb315429b20648199f",
      "text": "一开始什么都不懂，真的很辛苦呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f181a5db1d3eafb7c4fed9b51078276d1022d85a6799885851f5c146ccb8a205",
      "text": "浇水的分量、对光照的喜好、扎花束的方法……\n有太多东西需要去学了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c5b762abc1e27b4f3a1643fec3734ab33f86d21823cd287d4ec40d0ddc20881b",
      "text": "不过，在这样不断接触的过程中，\n我就越来越喜欢花了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:679f89807b71e19a77000b016b7d24186d20129e2326044f8848a86009e612d6",
      "text": "实先生对花这么了解，\n正是出于对花朵的喜爱与努力的成果呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_b:cmd-000074:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:5079cbc103a9bb8ce6483117f03675044a984ad67afa5a8ec4c335a6ef83c7f4",
      "text": "是啊。而且，这也是叔叔……\n也是家里人喜欢的东西嘛。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000015:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d4d3d8aadb446771e3a0e7ecd290abc22bba7ec5c41ed4c75e70829c128c231e",
      "text": "那么，我就在明天的录制前把它完成好哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b30a82fc80966f833e25e296485a76bcd99b02713a0b292428979d5bc86dc456",
      "text": "就拜托您了！\n感觉已经有些等不及明天了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000025:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:97233f209833a5e2b98659e641273bdb80aa521871f6c7082e7d9ba32207d4a7",
      "text": "呵呵，敬请期待吧！\n我会做出最棒的插花的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000034:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:de032b14ad770092a08e64ee0b7359b1bdf150548e5d96e8eacb1487cc8ae481",
      "text": "翌日……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000045:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:586f210a900d3a4fa933562c9ce62f4db8a6bdf93da60f3c64288c5866749f4c",
      "text": "……嗯，做得很顺利。\n这样肯定能让对方高兴的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000051:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:d8955a09c580c1db54131e378d1deec3fb179ce0777a91776e75c9d2b8b16d0e",
      "text": "好啦，制作人差不多也该到了吧？\n已经到碰头的时间了……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000061:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a2c2bf80d53c1f336d7b0ca52f50aaa9a03e7ee684b6b719c5848439200ca794",
      "text": "实先生，不好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000064:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8226e7d19d9d166c9f88a15b6b97b28c3dd3e20c85f909c3894192b9a9250996",
      "text": "哎？怎么了，●●●●プロデューサー。\n这么慌张。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000069:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:a1a20c861f8b6a7be687c1445a89802401bc22c591f197261490d090da121683",
      "text": "电车因为故障停运了……\n听说目前还没有恢复运行的眉目。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_c:cmd-000072:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:8ec2daa08b2aa6220de9aabd8c36c48c021589a30a05a7d59ab2cf1625c5582e",
      "text": "哎。那今天的录制该怎么办……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000012:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:c6812405261b32556ab96f2a7743bc8c993cf6e174076d4744f4d266e9da9bf2",
      "text": "虽然暂时叫了出租车，\n但受故障的影响，听说要很久才能到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000017:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb6b9857476eef6d8b4b803a594464e4a0e21cafd2fdfd2f12ec7369bc994258",
      "text": "这样啊。\n没事的，●●●●プロデューサー。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000020:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:58b0e970a7154805b730c7b8b8c1de11e8ba344e7e958f428d8b770162b6c66a",
      "text": "哎？",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000027:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:137df7162cc75da5330d12c5e6ea40f3362b269b0ee718ae8f46691a3734ca9e",
      "text": "我今天可是骑摩托来的哦。\n我们两个人骑摩托去现场吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000030:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:af125c81d74cf1dffbc36b23f07ab73801ac710cbee7bf8915cc5ceff48d3f3e",
      "text": "大马路上肯定很堵，但要是抄近路走小巷，\n应该能赶在约定时间前到达的。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000032:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:bcc044a1e9554ba8fe4dfe36c45159ae5ee2c9f0cbec4de6c765c57e785f1364",
      "text": "不好意思！能拜托您吗，实先生。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000039:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b821e73d1b7e01377f24ee48f93355da77c52e35e8235c759cb1e2113b0d010f",
      "text": "当然！那就拿着吧，虽然是我的旧头盔，\n●●●●プロデューサー也戴上吧。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000055:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:2df95d174384ab57399c57c5944dec2d507a0547a20bd62722011bd5f0cb5990",
      "text": "坐在我身后，抓紧我哦。\n还有，花也拜托你拿好了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000057:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:44a5c9c6f018c41350267af73df2b5b7aeecf4dffbc006f326c76ec7a1eccbee",
      "text": "好、好的，明白了！\n拜托您了！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_d:cmd-000059:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:e222d2afd83a0a4f9c406e0c750462f1cdfb14789200867e464d057cbf918215",
      "text": "嗯！绝对会让大家赶上的，交给我吧！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000010:time_caption:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:4f10f377623d30a2f8e6eef9924c2cd8b7962dcbd80ad5f1e46aca35a570d7f4",
      "text": "录制后……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000019:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:0e486da89aa928e634355667bcfc0feb9fccb33f2c0909a296bb3da2b0ee0ff2",
      "text": "呼。录制顺利结束了呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000024:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:f150c1a47bad6a869a0a9ab189da1767f3fd8f6b2cf2f95e0a51f8cc655fc2e9",
      "text": "录制辛苦了。另外……\n这次真的非常感谢您！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000028:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:29d1c2c0d496a890212a1945bed86daef5f13eddb2c3ba406889ee34a963525e",
      "text": "不用客气！\n能帮上忙我也很高兴哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000034:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:118fee1fec73fc2318c0513983289b66bfad229806b500bf984517653b0265be",
      "text": "而且礼物能让对方那么开心真是太好了。\n这都要多亏制作人一直护着它呢。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000037:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:744a80ebf445a9408f63ccca4b5f2516a46185bea4f55fbb9f4328942f5c6fcb",
      "text": "能把实先生做好的插花\n平安无事地送达真是太好了。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000041:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:1f37a3de9ba7dde6f45be4ef28ba62c8197280b443879b20196148dab7e61933",
      "text": "不过真不可思议呢。路上堵成那样，\n竟然真的能按时赶到……",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000046:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:b1ce79b607ecfebbe558e9cbf58af5c332882008d0a482bb34b92ae09731a5d2",
      "text": "因为我抄了不少近路嘛。\n我骑车的时候很擅长找近道哦。",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000054:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:95233189cc27ac4caa484cf1e48f6d4ec9d5dd2a1bedef846c12f9dff5253022",
      "text": "（……虽然这招是以前为了甩掉警察\n和打架的对手才练出来的）",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000065:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:eb3d4206625c5c3141ede9d7e39058c9685c973cc0122a47290ff8f4bd95a09f",
      "text": "要是以后又遇到麻烦，尽管来找我商量哦。\n我会帮你的！",
      "status": "draft"
    },
    "story-text:v1:1_2_011min_01_1_2_011_01:1_2_011_01_e:cmd-000068:dialogue:000": {
      "source_hash": "sha256:14e8e244c93400c47e092e60f9c465af9d806331ad388e8b971f0a65ff95f328",
      "text": "好的，就仰仗您了。实先生！",
      "status": "draft"
    }
  }
}
